+/** 26 Oct optimisation: the full reads of ENDED items (Completed, Withdrawn, Rejected, Cancelled), kept for the session
+ *  per client and persona, so that a reload reads in full only the open items (before, every load read every item of a
+ *  flow again, one call each). A kept read is used again only while its case's history (the CIQ Audit Event rows that
+ *  name the case) is unchanged: a later change of an ended item writes a history row on its case (the final PDF, a
+ *  reopen, a history update), and that new row has the case's ended items read again. The list row must still show
+ *  the kept status. Nothing is kept when this load could not read the history. */
+interface KeptFull {
+  item: RawItem;
+  sig: string;
